ractical-2026-2-java-1","number":14,"type":"서술형","points":5,"body_html":"<div class=\"q-text\">다음은 Java 코드에 대한 문제이다. 아래 코드를 확인하여 알맞은 출력값을 작성하시오.</div><pre class=\"qcode\"><code class=\"language-java\">class A {\n    private int a;\n\n    public A(int a) {\n        this.a = a;\n    }\n\n    void print() {\n        System.out.print(a + \"a\");\n    }\n}\n\nclass B extends A {\n    private int b;\n\n    B(int a, int b) {\n        super(a);\n        this.b = b;\n    }\n\n    void print() {\n        super.print();\n        System.out.print(b + \"b\");\n    }\n}\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        B obj = new B(10, 20);\n        obj.print();\n    }\n}</code></pre>","choices":[],"answer_no":null,"answer_text":"10a20b","answer_num":null,"round_digits":null,"tolerance":null,"dataset":null,"model":null,"code":null,"code_lang":null,"keywords":["java","inherit","super 생성자 · print 오버라이딩"],"round_no":2,"round_label":"정보처리기사 실기 2026년 2회","card_label":null,"year":2026,"unit_no":10,"unit_name":"Java","group_key":"lang-java","group_name":"Java"},{"id":"6a807b7d5fb4deb1937c708c","unit_id":"3e763e8d8505a1722e19322a","ref":"info-processing-practical-2026-2-py-1","number":15,"type":"서술형","points":5,"body_html":"<div class=\"q-text\">다음은 파이썬 코드에 대한 문제이다. 아래 코드를 확인하여 알맞은 출력값을 작성하시오.</div><pre class=\"qcode\"><code class=\"language-python\">class LocationDict:\n    locations = {\n        \"NYC\": \"New York\",\n        \"LON\": \"London\",\n        \"PAR\": \"Paris\",\n        \"TKY\": \"Tokyo\"\n    }\n\ntmpdict = LocationDict()\nstr01 = \"\"\nfor key, location in tmpdict.locations.items():\n    keyk = key[-1]\n    locationk = location[0]\n    str01 += keyk + locationk\n\nprint(str01, end=\"\")</code></pre>","choices":[],"answer_no":null,"answer_text":"CNNLRPYT","answer_num":null,"round_digits":null,"tolerance":null,"dataset":null,"model":null,"code":null,"code_lang":null,"keywords":["python","dict","키 끝글자 + 값 첫글자 연결"],"round_no":2,"round_label":"정보처리기사 실기 2026년 2회","card_label":null,"year":2026,"unit_no":8,"unit_name":"Python","group_key":"lang-python","group_name":"Python"},{"id":"6a807b7d5fb4deb1937c708d","unit_id":"3e763e8d8505a1722e19322a","ref":"info-processing-practical-2026-2-py-2","number":16,"type":"서술형","points":5,"body_html":"<div class=\"q-text\">다음은 파이썬 코드에 대한 문제이다. 아래 코드를 확인하여 알맞은 출력값을 작성하시오.</div><pre class=\"qcode\"><code class=\"language-python\">a = \"_THIS_IS_KIM_SPEAKING\"\nb = a[:4]\nc = a[6:8]\nd = a[18:]\ne = b + c + d\nprint(e)</code></pre>","choices":[],"answer_no":null,"answer_text":"_THIISING","answer_num":null,"round_digits":null,"tolerance":null,"dataset":null,"model":null,"code":null,"code_lang":null,"keywords":["python","string","슬라이싱 연결"],"round_no":2,"round_label":"정보처리기사 실기 2026년 2회","card_label":null,"year":2026,"unit_no":8,"unit_name":"Python","group_key":"lang-python","group_name":"Python"},{"id":"6a807b7d5fb4deb1937c708e","unit_id":"bb0d3f46525805dfcc917118","ref":"info-processing-practical-2026-2-c-1","number":17,"type":"서술형","points":5,"body_html":"<div class=\"q-text\">다음은 C언어 코드에 대한 문제이다. 아래 코드를 확인하여 알맞은 출력값을 작성하시오.</div><pre class=\"qcode\"><code class=\"language-c\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\n\ntypedef struct N {\n    int v;\n    struct N* a;\n    struct N* b;\n} N;\n\nint c = 0;\nint ans = 0;\n\nvoid pst(N *n) {\n    if (!n) return;\n    pst(n-&gt;a);\n    pst(n-&gt;b);\n    if (++c == 3) ans = n-&gt;v;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    N ne = {35, 0, 0};\n    N nd = {64, 0, 0};\n    N nc = {53, 0, 0};\n    N nb = {12, &amp;ne, &amp;nc};\n    N na = {21, &amp;nb, &amp;nd};\n\n    pst(&amp;na);\n    printf(\"%d\\n\", ans);\n    return 0;\n}</code></pre>","choices":[],"answer_no":null,"answer_text":"12","answer_num":null,"round_digits":null,"tolerance":null,"dataset":null,"model":null,"code":null,"code_lang":null,"keywords":["c","tree","이진트리 후위순회 3번째 방문"],"round_no":2,"round_label":"정보처리기사 실기 2026년 2회","card_label":null,"year":2026,"unit_no":9,"unit_name":"C언어","group_key":"lang-c","group_name":"C언어"},{"id":"6a807b7d5fb4deb1937c708f","unit_id":"bb0d3f46525805dfcc917118","ref":"info-processing-practical-2026-2-c-2","number":18,"type":"서술형","points":5,"body_html":"<div class=\"q-text\">다음은 C언어 코드에 대한 문제이다. 아래 코드를 확인하여 알맞은 출력값을 작성하시오.</div><pre class=\"qcode\"><code class=\"language-c\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\n\nvoid fn1(int* i) { *i = 50; }\nvoid fn2(int i) { i = 60; }\n\nvoid fn34(int* p) {\n    printf(\"3. %d\\n\", *p);\n    printf(\"4. %d\\n\", *(p + 3));\n}\n\nint main() {\n    int i = 30;\n    int list[] = {2, 4, 6, 8, 10};\n\n    fn1(&amp;i);\n    printf(\"1. %d\\n\", i);\n\n    fn2(i);\n    printf(\"2. %d\\n\", i);\n\n    fn34(list);\n\n    return 0;\n}</code></pre>","choices":[],"answer_no":null,"answer_text":"1. 50\n2. 50\n3. 2\n4. 8","answer_num":null,"round_digits":null,"tolerance":null,"dataset":null,"model":null,"code":null,"code_lang":null,"keywords":["c","pointer","포인터 전달 vs 값 전달 · 배열"],"round_no":2,"round_label":"정보처리기사 실기 2026년 2회","card_label":null,"year":2026,"unit_no":9,"unit_name":"C언어","group_key":"lang-c","group_name":"C언어"},{"id":"6a807b7d5fb4deb1937c7090","unit_id":"330331701cdca0278079d6c7","ref":"info-processing-practical-2026-2-java-2","number":19,"type":"서술형","points":5,"body_html":"<div class=\"q-text\">다음은 Java 코드에 대한 문제이다. 아래 코드를 확인하여 알맞은 출력값을 작성하시오.</div><pre class=\"qcode\"><code class=\"language-java\">class A {\n    int a;\n    private int b;\n    protected int c;\n\n    void set(int aa, int bb, int cc) {\n        a = aa;\n        b = bb;\n        c = cc;\n    }\n\n    int hap() { return a + b + c; }\n}\n\nclass B extends A {\n    public int hap() { return a * c; }\n}\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        A aaa = new A();\n        B bbb = new B();\n\n        aaa.set(1, 5, 3);\n        bbb.set(10, 30, 50);\n\n        System.out.print(aaa.hap() + bbb.hap());\n    }\n}</code></pre>","choices":[],"answer_no":null,"answer_text":"509","answer_num":null,"round_digits":null,"tolerance":null,"dataset":null,"model":null,"code":null,"code_lang":null,"keywords":["java","inherit","오버라이딩 hap · 합산 출력"],"round_no":2,"round_label":"정보처리기사 실기 2026년 2회","card_label":null,"year":2026,"unit_no":10,"unit_name":"Java","group_key":"lang-java","group_name":"Java"},{"id":"6a807b7d5fb4deb1937c7091","unit_id":"bb0d3f46525805dfcc917118","ref":"info-processing-practical-2026-2-c-3","number":20,"type":"서술형","points":5,"body_html":"<div class=\"q-text\">다음은 C언어 코드에 대한 문제이다. 아래 코드를 확인하여 알맞은 출력값을 작성하시오.</div><pre class=\"qcode\"><code class=\"language-c\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\n\nint c(int n) {\n    if (n &lt;= 1) return n;\n    return c(n - 1) + c(n - 3);\n}\n\nint main() {\n    printf(\"%d\", c(5));\n    return 0;\n}</code></pre>","choices":[],"answer_no":null,"answer_text":"1","answer_num":null,"round_digits":null,"tolerance":null,"dataset":null,"model":null,"code":null,"code_lang":null,"keywords":["c","recursion","c(n-1)+c(n-3) 재귀"],"round_no":2,"round_label":"정보처리기사 실기 2026년 2회","card_label":null,"year":2026,"unit_no":9,"unit_name":"C언어","group_key":"lang-c","group_name":"C언어"}]}